# Media is generated, not committed. A judge cloning this should not wait on a
# 40MB download to run the tests, and every artifact here is reproducible:
#   python scripts/make_sample.py    -> samples/synthetic.mp4
#   python scripts/make_demo.py      -> samples/demo.mp4 (narrated)
#   python scripts/make_assets.py    -> assets/cc_music/glacier_calm.mp3
samples/*.mp4
samples/*.mov
samples/*.mkv
samples/*.wav
public/media/*.mp4
assets/cc_music/*.mp3

